NCT04842526.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Written informed consent was signed before admission;
2. Under 21 years old, both male and female;
3. Patients with distant metastasis or locally advanced neuroblastoma judged by the researchers to be unsuitable for surgical treatment;
